6th Sub. H.B. 44
School Security Personnel Standards
House Amendments Amendment 2 March 03, 2026 04:22 PM
Representative Ryan D. Wilcox proposes the following amendments:
1. Line 878 through 886:
878 (2) (a) Subject to Subsection (2)(b) and except as provided in Subsection 53G-8-701.5(3),
879 every campus within an LEA shall designate a school safety and security specialist
880 from the employees of the relevant campus.
881 (b) (i) Except as provided in Subsection (2)(b)(ii), {The} the school safety and security
specialist:
882 {(i)} (A) may not be a principal or a teacher; and
883 {(ii)} (B) may be the school safety and security director at one campus within the LEA.
(ii) A principal or teacher may be the school safety and security specialist if approved in
accordance with Subsection 53G-8-701.5(3).
884 (3) The school safety and security specialist shall:
885 (a) report directly to the principal;
886 (b) oversee school safety and security practices to ensure a safe and secure school
